"""A fourth sweep of everyday Excel macros, written the way macros are: several objects together to do one job. Reports built from a
list, duplicates taken out with a dictionary, lookups, arrays read and written back, charts built from a region, and sheets
added, filled, moved and tidied.

Like scripts/measure_excel_everyday.py, each probe works on a sheet of its own that it deletes afterwards, and is recorded as
its answer or the run-time error it stopped with (see vba_probe_fixture.py).

    python scripts/measure_excel_everyday_4.py

writes tests/fixtures/excel_everyday_4.json, which tests/test_excel_everyday_4.py replays.
"""
